{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"188.29.166.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb48339b2a7d0b63cf2c1bee331fa69e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That is a great garment bag, but I&#039;m in the UK I wonder if the ship them to other countries.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871071,"PostDate":1410251309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That is a great garment bag, but I'm in the UK I wonder if the ship them to other countries.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justineatack@gmail.com","IpAddress":"31.54.1.116","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409997456,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279711.jpg?_r=1410256327","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2b15","Id":279711,"Name":"Bride2b15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cec4092f082d7240dc175c81a8049e56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Bride2b15\"] do you have Amazon or something similar? Also, I would check with any luggage stores that could maybe order it for you or could find something similar.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871093,"PostDate":1410261997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279711\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279711-bride2b15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2b15<\/span><\/a> do you have Amazon or something similar? Also, I would check with any luggage stores that could maybe order it for you or could find something similar.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"holly_youngquist@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399555622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hyoungquist","Id":277896,"Name":"hyoungquist","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.156.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30317df21634125131e8cc141f3c7c2a","RawContent":"I bought a wally bag from another bride on here...excited!  Hoping they let me hang it on the plane","Attachments":[],"Id":1872172,"PostDate":1411033952,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I bought a wally bag from another bride on here...excited!  Hoping they let me hang it on the plane\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f61b438b65197fc055a2054aac565ebe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/150039759\/personalized-2-piece-luggage-set-garment?ref=sr_gallery_36&amp;amp;ga_search_query=weekender+bag&amp;amp;ga_ref=auto1&amp;amp;ga_search_type=all&amp;amp;ga_view_type=gallery&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/150039759\/personalized-2-piece-luggage-set-garment?ref=sr_gallery_36&amp;amp;ga_search_query=weekender+bag&amp;amp;ga_ref=auto1&amp;amp;ga_search_type=all&amp;amp;ga_view_type=gallery&lt;\/a&gt; found this cute one on Etsy but not sure it would fit my dress. &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872356,"PostDate":1411132462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/150039759\/personalized-2-piece-luggage-set-garment?ref=sr_gallery_36&ga_search_query=weekender+bag&ga_ref=auto1&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ew_type=gallery<\/a> found this cute one on Etsy but not sure it would fit my dress. <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"holly_youngquist@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399555622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hyoungquist","Id":277896,"Name":"hyoungquist","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.90.157.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb8e6a65facb3d64ace795586587eb91","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow... I didn&#039;t even think about a special bag for my dress! Yikes! Talk about details....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since my dress will be light and airy it shouldn&#039;t be too big a deal for me, I mean in the way of I don&#039;t have ruffles or anything to crush. Now I just have to confirm my resorts steaming process.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872965,"PostDate":1411553176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow... I didn't even think about a special bag for my dress! Yikes! Talk about details....<\/p>\n<p>Since my dress will be light and airy it shouldn't be too big a deal for me, I mean in the way of I don't have ruffles or anything to crush. Now I just have to confirm my resorts steaming process.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"denisetravis324@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.97.137.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376604232,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272639.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nissi324","Id":272639,"Name":"Nissi324","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.187.236.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52eb38e2b3e361328632d843a54b63b3","RawContent":"I&#039;m going to do the wallybag too. I&#039;m bringing so many other dresses for the trip, I might as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873080,"PostDate":1411633972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm going to do the wallybag too. I'm bringing so many other dresses for the trip, I might as well.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justjennelle@aol.com","IpAddress":"69.115.153.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370257635,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270220.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":122,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennelleRM","Id":270220,"Name":"JennelleRM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.97.5.251","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ce6cf99707cf94fcf118ad181c695f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I bought a rolling garment bag from ebags. Its blue and can&#039;t remember the name at the moment. It is going to fit my dress, atleast 5 of my FI shirts and enough spare clothes for 2 days. Its AWESOME!!! I highly recommend finding something on wheels if you are having to lug stuff thru airports! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Plus it cut our carryons in half... not I have more space to bring the rest of my crap on the plane!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873104,"PostDate":1411646985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I bought a rolling garment bag from ebags. Its blue and can't remember the name at the moment. It is going to fit my dress, atleast 5 of my FI shirts and enough spare clothes for 2 days. Its AWESOME!!! I highly recommend finding something on wheels if you are having to lug stuff thru airports! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Plus it cut our carryons in half... not I have more space to bring the rest of my crap on the plane!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackielemman86@comcast.net","IpAddress":"70.123.142.233","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379785198,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273651.jpg?_r=1388803183","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackielemman","Id":273651,"Name":"jackielemman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ccf08d94e02cb83333ca03ad39d95e9e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here is a quick review on the wallybag....it worked great going to Cancun carried my wedding dress, second party dress, rehearsal dinner dress and 2 suits and men&#039;s shoes, it folded up nicely and then we hung it on the plane&#039;s closet. &amp;nbsp;I think we might have overpacked it too much because when we used it again to bring my 2 dresses and my husbands outfits to Playa Del Carmen for our TTD the shoulder straps both broke off. &amp;nbsp;We could still use it by holding it by the hand straps and that&#039;s what we did when we packed my dress and his suits on the way back home. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So basically do not overfill it or the weight of everything will start to unstitch the straps. &amp;nbsp;I got my as a bridal gift from bed bath and beyond so I&#039;m going to try to see if I can return it because all though it was heavy it does advertise that we should be able to hang 7 garments and we only had 5 so we&#039;ll see.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873137,"PostDate":1411658356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here is a quick review on the wallybag....it worked great going to Cancun carried my wedding dress, second party dress, rehearsal dinner dress and 2 suits and men's shoes, it folded up nicely and then we hung it on the plane's closet. \u00a0I think we might have overpacked it too much because when we used it again to bring my 2 dresses and my husbands outfits to Playa Del Carmen for our TTD the shoulder straps both broke off. \u00a0We could still use it by holding it by the hand straps and that's what we did when we packed my dress and his suits on the way back home. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So basically do not overfill it or the weight of everything will start to unstitch the straps. \u00a0I got my as a bridal gift from bed bath and beyond so I'm going to try to see if I can return it because all though it was heavy it does advertise that we should be able to hang 7 garments and we only had 5 so we'll see.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":18,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
