{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36fbd91c3ddb6eccee2ef40e28414ac5","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married at the Grand Oasis Marien, DR in April and my fiance is worried about her wedding dress arriving wrinkled. How have you prevented it being crushed? Should we have it pressed before we leave? The resort isn&#039;t able to do it at their laundry. Any advice or help would be greatly appreciated, especially by my fiance! Thanks! :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1057632,"PostDate":1267550760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married at the Grand Oasis Marien, DR in April and my fiance is worried about her wedding dress arriving wrinkled. How have you prevented it being crushed? Should we have it pressed before we leave? The resort isn't able to do it at their laundry. Any advice or help would be greatly appreciated, especially by my fiance! Thanks! :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cfthunderbird@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1253544629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cfthunder","Id":221844,"Name":"Cfthunder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aab82587f94f3d1c9ae70b56f17d6bdf","RawContent":"I plan on carrying my dress as a carry-on for my flight. From what I&#039;ve read on my airlines website (and talking to their CSR&#039;s), they&#039;re more than happy to hang it somewhere so that it doesn&#039;t get wrinkled. \n \n If the dress needs steamed or pressed, be sure to do it before if the resort doesn&#039;t have the resources to do it for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1057666,"PostDate":1267551491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I plan on carrying my dress as a carry-on for my flight. From what I've read on my airlines website (and talking to their CSR's), they're more than happy to hang it somewhere so that it doesn't get wrinkled. <br \/> <br \/> If the dress needs steamed or pressed, be sure to do it before if the resort doesn't have the resources to do it for you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i1009.photobucket.com\/albums\/af215\/cranstonba\/3008_86364263754_511593754_2566972_.jpg\">http:\/\/i1009.photobucket.com\/albums\/...4_2566972_.jpg<\/a><br><br><strong>Brandi & Doug - November 5, 2010<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/brandianddoug\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/brandianddoug<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/mPwAm5.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/mPwAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"brandibowers@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1263796196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224801.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWbridetobe","Id":224801,"Name":"DWbridetobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3c743b2f5cf2e740524beeded8677f3","RawContent":"You might find some answers in this thread: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f54\/traveling-dress-48967\/\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...g-dress-48967\/&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1058869,"PostDate":1267586174,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You might find some answers in this thread: <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f54\/traveling-dress-48967\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati....g-dress-48967\/<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"princess402@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1207257466,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209009.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":96,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Princess402","Id":209009,"Name":"Princess402","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f05417c30f0bbb689b0b57c829558a1","RawContent":"I am having my mom carry my dress in her carry on bag.","Attachments":[],"Id":1058876,"PostDate":1267586262,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am having my mom carry my dress in her carry on bag.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"momichele@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1262139172,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224185.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"momichele","Id":224185,"Name":"momichele","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99fb76f4a41befd26238fd8fe198c4f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m carrying it on&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590727,"PostDate":1330997831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm carrying it on<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"huarageil@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1310054108,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242048.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stefkva","Id":242048,"Name":"stefkva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f7203e42f7f9aca3a0a9f1e67fe707a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i bought this and will carry it on:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/U-S-Traveler-Leather-Carry-On-Garment\/dp\/B001Z4HQD4\/ref=sr_1_12?s=apparel&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1341870096&amp;amp;sr=1-12\"&gt;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/U-S-Traveler-Leather-Carry-On-Garment\/dp\/B001Z4HQD4\/ref=sr_1_12?s=apparel&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1341870096&amp;amp;sr=1-12&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1639747,"PostDate":1341855821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i bought this and will carry it on:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/U-S-Traveler-Leather-Carry-On-Garment\/dp\/B001Z4HQD4\/ref=sr_1_12?s=apparel&ie=UTF8&qid=1341870096&sr=1-12' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co...1870096&sr=1-12<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Kip & Kate<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>August 4, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Dreams Riviera Cancun<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.kipandkateswedding.com\">www.kipandkateswedding.com<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>30 guests<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kmarrazzo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1327437682,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250457.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RollerBride","Id":250457,"Name":"RollerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4cb6ef21fbcee13d90832c529ae42f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; how did people handle this? i heard you can call and ask to hang it up or buy it its own seat but i am unsure what to do&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1651384,"PostDate":1344681674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> how did people handle this? i heard you can call and ask to hang it up or buy it its own seat but i am unsure what to do<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wallaby_meisje@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344619254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259034.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"wallabymeisje","Id":259034,"Name":"wallabymeisje","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32b9c74c5f89a5d6eb9ecb647a1e4fc3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve heard some airlines have&amp;nbsp;a place to hang it for you, but not to count on it because sometimes they wont even if they&#039;ve agreed to it prior. I&#039;m having my dress steamed before I go and I&#039;m just going to nicely fold it in half and put it in the above carry on area ontop of the luggage so it doesn&#039;t get squished. Then when we arrive I&#039;m going to hang it in the bathroom and crank the hot water and do my own kind of&amp;nbsp;steaming&amp;nbsp;to get any wrinkles out of it from the flight. &amp;nbsp;The lady at the dress shop&amp;nbsp;told me that was the best way to go because you can&#039;t always count on the airline keeping it hung up for you. It also&amp;nbsp;kind of depends on the material of the dress and if it wrinkles easily or not....hope that helps a little bit.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1653180,"PostDate":1345053163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've heard some airlines have\u00a0a place to hang it for you, but not to count on it because sometimes they wont even if they've agreed to it prior. I'm having my dress steamed before I go and I'm just going to nicely fold it in half and put it in the above carry on area ontop of the luggage so it doesn't get squished. Then when we arrive I'm going to hang it in the bathroom and crank the hot water and do my own kind of\u00a0steaming\u00a0to get any wrinkles out of it from the flight. \u00a0The lady at the dress shop\u00a0told me that was the best way to go because you can't always count on the airline keeping it hung up for you. It also\u00a0kind of depends on the material of the dress and if it wrinkles easily or not....hope that helps a little bit.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dallacekobi@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311021236,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242490.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dallace","Id":242490,"Name":"dallace","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14a5f80d7c8e17e64b32cd4450878247","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i think i am going to do it carry on as well, it is better to have it with you than with anyone else&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1764029,"PostDate":1370285972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i think i am going to do it carry on as well, it is better to have it with you than with anyone else<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"backyyuen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.87.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363371265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267403.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Backy","Id":267403,"Name":"Backy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d567e756944a7ddd0a3871303116c593","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]dallace[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;ve heard some airlines have a place to hang it for you, but not to count on it because sometimes they wont even if they&#039;ve agreed to it prior. I&#039;m having my dress steamed before I go and I&#039;m just going to nicely fold it in half and put it in the above carry on area ontop of the luggage so it doesn&#039;t get squished. Then when we arrive I&#039;m going to hang it in the bathroom and crank the hot water and do my own kind of steaming to get any wrinkles out of it from the flight.  The lady at the dress shop told me that was the best way to go because you can&#039;t always count on the airline keeping it hung up for you. It also kind of depends on the material of the dress and if it wrinkles easily or not....hope that helps a little bit.[\/quote] \n \n This is a great idea. I&#039;m planning to carry on, but I was worried the airline would decide not to hang it up for me when I get there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1764063,"PostDate":1370292934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>dallace<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I've heard some airlines have\u00a0a place to hang it for you, but not to count on it because sometimes they wont even if they've agreed to it prior. I'm having my dress steamed before I go and I'm just going to nicely fold it in half and put it in the above carry on area ontop of the luggage so it doesn't get squished. Then when we arrive I'm going to hang it in the bathroom and crank the hot water and do my own kind of\u00a0steaming\u00a0to get any wrinkles out of it from the flight. \u00a0The lady at the dress shop\u00a0told me that was the best way to go because you can't always count on the airline keeping it hung up for you. It also\u00a0kind of depends on the material of the dress and if it wrinkles easily or not....hope that helps a little bit.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is a great idea. I'm planning to carry on, but I was worried the airline would decide not to hang it up for me when I get there.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dubhreubel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.52.246.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369122651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269805.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephLB","Id":269805,"Name":"StephLB","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
