> Time: 1460852944 / Sun, 17 Apr 2016 00:29:04 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=49039&start=10&SessionId=106bdc289ea1e3bafdc8d44b30d82a37
> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96752d18cf6852a68e2e20c8e2c1f5fd","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;StephLB&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a great idea. I&#039;m planning to carry on, but I was worried the airline would decide not to hang it up for me when I get there.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; After reading this I decided to call the airline my FI and will be traveling through and I was told I can carry on my dress as long as it will fit in the overhead. She said they do not have a closet to hang it in. So I will be getting one of those air bags that I&#039;m able to suck the air out and pack my dress in an carry on suitcase. I will get it steamed at the resort once we arrive. Oh, we&#039;re flying US Airways.","Attachments":[],"Id":1800749,"PostDate":1379437418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>StephLB<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>This is a great idea. I'm planning to carry on, but I was worried the airline would decide not to hang it up for me when I get there.<\/p><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> After reading this I decided to call the airline my FI and will be traveling through and I was told I can carry on my dress as long as it will fit in the overhead. She said they do not have a closet to hang it in. So I will be getting one of those air bags that I'm able to suck the air out and pack my dress in an carry on suitcase. I will get it steamed at the resort once we arrive. Oh, we're flying US Airways.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374010532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cfc620ea4f6413f5899bd747f489c58","RawContent":"Most airlines will take it for her and put it in a closet in first class. Tell her not to worry just call the airline and ask them about hanging it in a closet... Good luck","Attachments":[],"Id":1801449,"PostDate":1379664057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Most airlines will take it for her and put it in a closet in first class. Tell her not to worry just call the airline and ask them about hanging it in a closet... Good luck\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378730769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ed0cdb13b59e87041d20c6ae1bdccf0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kay2015\"]\nMost airlines will take it for her and put it in a closet in first class. Tell her not to worry just call the airline and ask them about hanging it in a closet... Good luck[\/quote] You definitely want to call your airline first b\/c US Airways told me they didn&#039;t have anywhere to hang my gown that my only option is the overhead compartment.","Attachments":[],"Id":1801588,"PostDate":1379707094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"kay2015\" url=\"\/t\/56098\/travelling&#045;with&#045;a&#045;wedding&#045;dress#post_1949519\"><p>Most airlines will take it for her and put it in a closet in first class. Tell her not to worry just call the airline and ask them about hanging it in a closet... Good luck<\/p><\/blockquote> You definitely want to call your airline first b\/c US Airways told me they didn't have anywhere to hang my gown that my only option is the overhead compartment.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374010532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1672123e561c8b1b9a127e2040ace40","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I put my dresses in the overhead bin, yes I said dresses. I had two dresses which were perfectly fine by the time I arrived in Cabo.&amp;nbsp;The closests are usually filled with the flight crew&#039;s bags or other equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1801600,"PostDate":1379711372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I put my dresses in the overhead bin, yes I said dresses. I had two dresses which were perfectly fine by the time I arrived in Cabo.\u00a0The closests are usually filled with the flight crew's bags or other equipment.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"day_ner@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.75.1.73","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1342711947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258078.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RNtoBe","Id":258078,"Name":"RNtoBe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18a28aba7e9cb6504a2fae7cc52ff172","RawContent":"Ya most of the airlines will accommadate wedding gowns for the brides good luck","Attachments":[],"Id":1801722,"PostDate":1379772454,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ya most of the airlines will accommadate wedding gowns for the brides good luck\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378730769,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3512b4cd78a5cffc204b0f08dc964ec2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RNtoBe\"]\nI put my dresses in the overhead bin, yes I said dresses. I had two dresses which were perfectly fine by the time I arrived in Cabo. The closests are usually filled with the flight crew&#039;s bags or other equipment. [\/quote] Did you use one of those zip n seal like bags, the ones you suck all the air out? Or did you just out it up there in its garment bag? I&#039;m trying to decide which method I&#039;m going to use since my airline said there is no closet to store it in.","Attachments":[],"Id":1801866,"PostDate":1379850747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"RNtoBe\" url=\"\/t\/56098\/travelling&#045;with&#045;a&#045;wedding&#045;dress#post_1949670\"><p>I put my dresses in the overhead bin, yes I said dresses. I had two dresses which were perfectly fine by the time I arrived in Cabo.\u00a0The closests are usually filled with the flight crew's bags or other equipment.\u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> Did you use one of those zip n seal like bags, the ones you suck all the air out? Or did you just out it up there in its garment bag? I'm trying to decide which method I'm going to use since my airline said there is no closet to store it in.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374010532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a59ed311af955bbfa2e9040f94d1b7c0","RawContent":"This part is making me worried.","Attachments":[],"Id":1802031,"PostDate":1379896642,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This part is making me worried.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Tara.basgall@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362223743,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266797.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tbasgall","Id":266797,"Name":"Tbasgall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07b082ff6f5d72e9cd3fd47b9076bea6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RollerBride\"]\ni bought this and will carry it on: [url=\"http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/redirect.html?ie=UTF8&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;camp=1789&amp;creative=9325&amp;tag=bestdestinationwedding-20&amp;location=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FU-S-Traveler-Leather-Carry-On-Garment%2Fdp%2FB001Z4HQD4%2Fref%3Dsr_1_12%3Fs%3Dapparel%26ie%3DUTF8%26qid%3D1341870096%26sr%3D1-12\"]http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/U-S-Traveler-Leather-Carry-On-Garment\/dp\/B001Z4HQD4\/ref=sr_1_12?s=apparel&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1341870096&amp;sr=1-12[\/url][\/quote] Thank you so much for this I wouldn&#039;t have thought of this :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1803376,"PostDate":1380370995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"RollerBride\" url=\"\/t\/56098\/travelling&#045;with&#045;a&#045;wedding&#045;dress#post_1789315\"><p>i bought this and will carry it on: <a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/redirect.html?ie=UTF8&linkCode=ur2&camp=1789&creative=9325&tag=bestdestinationwedding-20&location=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FU-S-Traveler-Leather-Carry-On-Garment%2Fdp%2FB001Z4HQD4%2Fref%3Dsr_1_12%3Fs%3Dapparel%26ie%3DUTF8%26qid%3D1341870096%26sr%3D1-12' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co...1870096&sr=1-12<\/a><\/p><\/blockquote> Thank you so much for this I wouldn't have thought of this <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rizolyaguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.89.64.141","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375960831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272367.jpg?_r=1403193511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"strwbsprkl","Id":272367,"Name":"strwbsprkl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d62009d096aa2fda4737481a5fec127","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;TuffLuv&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n \n Did you use one of those zip n seal like bags, the ones you suck all the air out? Or did you just out it up there in its garment bag? I&#039;m trying to decide which method I&#039;m going to use since my airline said there is no closet to store it in.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I used travel garment bags, they are bit thicker than a regular garment bag and have a loop at the bottom so you can hang the bottom over the hanger.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803580,"PostDate":1380459489,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>TuffLuv<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Did you use one of those zip n seal like bags, the ones you suck all the air out? Or did you just out it up there in its garment bag? I'm trying to decide which method I'm going to use since my airline said there is no closet to store it in.<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I used travel garment bags, they are bit thicker than a regular garment bag and have a loop at the bottom so you can hang the bottom over the hanger.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"day_ner@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.75.1.73","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1342711947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258078.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RNtoBe","Id":258078,"Name":"RNtoBe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0188e148ae90e3994f237b9ce6249ac2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RNtoBe\"]\nI used travel garment bags, they are bit thicker than a regular garment bag and have a loop at the bottom so you can hang the bottom over the hanger. [\/quote] Thank you. I will look into purchasing one.","Attachments":[],"Id":1803669,"PostDate":1380466140,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"RNtoBe\" url=\"\/t\/56098\/travelling&#045;with&#045;a&#045;wedding&#045;dress#post_1951650\"><p>I used travel garment bags, they are bit thicker than a regular garment bag and have a loop at the bottom so you can hang the bottom over the hanger.\u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> Thank you. I will look into purchasing one.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>Tuff Luv<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Reese & Kandie<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Hard Rock<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>April 12, 2014<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lonitaharlin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"156.63.33.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374010532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271619.jpeg?_r=1398882048","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TuffLuv","Id":271619,"Name":"TuffLuv","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
