Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3673761e29da92772b67e9dc38e93447","RawContent":"I am flying Delta. I called ahead of time, and their rep said they would gladly put it in the coat closet IF THERE WAS ROOM. I can&#039;t imagine the closet being that full, so I am taking my chances that my dress will be able to fit! Ahh..makes me a little nervous!","Attachments":[],"Id":85290,"PostDate":1185911326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am flying Delta. I called ahead of time, and their rep said they would gladly put it in the coat closet IF THERE WAS ROOM. I can't imagine the closet being that full, so I am taking my chances that my dress will be able to fit! Ahh..makes me a little nervous!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiehickman11@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1180451401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207428.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PVBride","Id":207428,"Name":"PVBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02ff197681174b2c55539375221b1bcb","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;sanchez0014&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;For those who carried on their dresses, did you buy a dress\/garmet bag? If so, where did you get it?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n \n When I picked up my dress at the store, the asked me if I wanted one. It was $10. Try your bridal shop, they probably have them.","Attachments":[],"Id":85366,"PostDate":1185917482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>sanchez0014<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">For those who carried on their dresses, did you buy a dress\/garmet bag? If so, where did you get it?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> <br \/> When I picked up my dress at the store, the asked me if I wanted one. It was $10. Try your bridal shop, they probably have them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizz10179@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.227.248.79","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1183263660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Spazz","Id":207506,"Name":"Spazz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5093f7fcda47da62cc358be323be6197","RawContent":"I flew Continental and carried mine on. I was expecting some kind of special treatment about hearing everyone else&#039;s stories...I even wore my &amp;quot;Bride&amp;quot; tank top. I also saw lots of ladies in the airport with big old dress bags.\n The closet they had to store my dress in front was about three feet tall, so not that great. One of the connections they let me lay it flat in first class. All-in-all, it wasn&#039;t too much of a pain, but I knew I was having it pressed when I got to Mexico, so no sweat about the close quarters.\n In no stretch of the imagination would I ever have checked my dress. You have to just be adamant, especially since they cost so much.","Attachments":[],"Id":85682,"PostDate":1185966303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I flew Continental and carried mine on. I was expecting some kind of special treatment about hearing everyone else's stories...I even wore my \"Bride\" tank top. I also saw lots of ladies in the airport with big old dress bags.<br \/> The closet they had to store my dress in front was about three feet tall, so not that great. One of the connections they let me lay it flat in first class. All-in-all, it wasn't too much of a pain, but I knew I was having it pressed when I got to Mexico, so no sweat about the close quarters.<br \/> In no stretch of the imagination would I ever have checked my dress. You have to just be adamant, especially since they cost so much.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i78.photobucket.com\/albums\/j83\/shaagensen\/tulum\/shellrings.jpg\">http:\/\/i78.photobucket.com\/albums\/j8...shellrings.jpg<\/a><br><span>Laura & Michael<\/span><br><span>07\/07\/07<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lauraabrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1171007381,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207143.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"laura b","Id":207143,"Name":"laura b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a1ecf8afefda659ac737ae4d00124e5","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lizz10179&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;When I picked up my dress at the store, the asked me if I wanted one. It was $10. Try your bridal shop, they probably have them.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;YOu know, $10 isn&#039;t much (that&#039;s what I had to pay for mine) but you would THINK that after spending mucho $$$$ in their bridal store that they could throw in the friggin&#039; dress bag .... right??&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile117.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile117\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":85763,"PostDate":1185976429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lizz10179<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">When I picked up my dress at the store, the asked me if I wanted one. It was $10. Try your bridal shop, they probably have them.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>YOu know, $10 isn't much (that's what I had to pay for mine) but you would THINK that after spending mucho $$$$ in their bridal store that they could throw in the friggin' dress bag .... right??<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile117.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile117\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177642740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df603d405b6cecc54a03f7d2db4a3838","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;foxytv&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;YOu know, $10 isn&#039;t much (that&#039;s what I had to pay for mine) but you would THINK that after spending mucho $$$$ in their bridal store that they could throw in the friggin&#039; dress bag .... right??&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile117.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile117\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I was thinking the same thing!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":85792,"PostDate":1185981168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>foxytv<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">YOu know, $10 isn't much (that's what I had to pay for mine) but you would THINK that after spending mucho $$$$ in their bridal store that they could throw in the friggin' dress bag .... right??<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile117.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile117\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I was thinking the same thing!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/i641.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu135\/dieselpug\/AdamMay2010226-1.jpg'>http:\/\/i641.photobucket.com\/albums\/u...y2010226-1.jpg<\/a>","Email":"shelleyringrose@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"96.234.167.104","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1181252160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207447.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsShelley","Id":207447,"Name":"MsShelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"813e60f0bc46bbed7b1683c589ab97f2","RawContent":"I know that WestJet will allow you to bring your dress on and either put in the closet or overhead bin... I still have to check with Air Canada but I imagine they would do the same..","Attachments":[],"Id":85827,"PostDate":1185984425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know that WestJet will allow you to bring your dress on and either put in the closet or overhead bin... I still have to check with Air Canada but I imagine they would do the same..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20081105\/e\/Our+wedding%21\/dt\/-3\/k\/9dd3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...9dd3\/event.png<\/a><br><br><span>My other babies, Oskar and Zoey!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t31226\">Chiquita's Planning Thread<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t32519\">Chiquita's Wedding Review<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jaysoncraig.com\/gallery\/main.php?g2_itemId=11445&g2_navId=x86485001\">Chiquita's Planning Photos<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jaysoncraig.com\/gallery\/main.php?g2_itemId=12401&g2_navId=x86485001\">Wedding\/Honeymoon Pics<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ms.chiquita@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1182279744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207480.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chiquita","Id":207480,"Name":"Chiquita","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c17feb1907edf489940cf73d2dfeefb1","RawContent":"We flew US Airways and had no problems storing my gown and Jay&#039;s suit in the coat check. I did call ahead because I did not want any surprises. My bridal boutique gave me one of those white sturdy plastic garment bags so thats what I used. No 1st class upgrades or champagne for us though. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/crybaby2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Crybaby2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n It was just a pain to carry the gown through the airport and I was super glad the resort was steaming and ironing our wedding garments","Attachments":[],"Id":86092,"PostDate":1186002085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We flew US Airways and had no problems storing my gown and Jay's suit in the coat check. I did call ahead because I did not want any surprises. My bridal boutique gave me one of those white sturdy plastic garment bags so thats what I used. No 1st class upgrades or champagne for us though. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/crybaby2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Crybaby2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> It was just a pain to carry the gown through the airport and I was super glad the resort was steaming and ironing our wedding garments\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><center><embed src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.widdlytinks.com\/pregnancy\/pregnancy-tickers\/pregnancyticker.swf\">http:\/\/www.widdlytinks.com\/pregnancy\/pregnancy-tickers\/pregnancyticker.swf<\/a><span>\" FlashVars=\"t1=Baby Lambert is on the way&b=7&c=0xCC00CC&f=5&y=2010&m=4&d=14\" quality=\"high\" wmode=\"transparent\" width=\"430\" height=\"115\" name=\"Pregnancy Ticker\" align=\"middle\"...<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.macromedia.com\/go\/getflashplayer\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.widdlytinks.com\/\"><\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"luckeek72@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1173495120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207249.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Karen","Id":207249,"Name":"Karen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c98501695cee15feb0dd8220f36b4cc6","RawContent":"I know most of them can hang it in there closet on the plane if you talk to someone in advance about it","Attachments":[],"Id":86098,"PostDate":1186002326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know most of them can hang it in there closet on the plane if you talk to someone in advance about it\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"studio549visualarts@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1185309900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207557.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smwatson","Id":207557,"Name":"smwatson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c45a3a9a8e66060fbcaff1642792a94c","RawContent":"my future cousin-in-law is a flight attendant for continental and she told me to ask to put my dress in the closet. she said i could call ahead, but all they would say was &amp;quot;ok, we&#039;ll make a note of it&amp;quot;....she said she&#039;s always been really good with brides bringing their dresses on flights....so hopefully i will get someone as nice as her! \n \n would love for her to fly on our flight!! lol\n guess i should ask my bridal shop about the $10 garment bag too!! lol...anyway to get more money out of us, huh!","Attachments":[],"Id":86243,"PostDate":1186016922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                my future cousin-in-law is a flight attendant for continental and she told me to ask to put my dress in the closet. she said i could call ahead, but all they would say was \"ok, we'll make a note of it\"....she said she's always been really good with brides bringing their dresses on flights....so hopefully i will get someone as nice as her! <br \/> <br \/> would love for her to fly on our flight!! lol<br \/> guess i should ask my bridal shop about the $10 garment bag too!! lol...anyway to get more money out of us, huh!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;6\/st\/20080516\/e\/our+wedding%21\/k\/1d17\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1d17\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"graceful_steph@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1183210279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207503.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":95,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gracefulsteph","Id":207503,"Name":"gracefulsteph","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df8e04d0744d17b95d9c69be7716c59c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;gkashmira&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I walked right onto an American Airlines flight with no problem at all. I called ahead of time and they told me just to carry it on and ask to hang it in the front coat closet.\n \n In fact by doing this we also brought it to the stewardess&#039; attention and later they moved us to first class... I swear I&#039;m carrying a large white garment bag whenever I travel - even if it&#039;s empty! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;host&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;not only did the airline let me carry on my dress, but they treated me like a VIP and let me board the airplane first and put my dress in the locker for the stewardesses\/pilots.\n \n i dont think there is a list of airlines that will have something this specific but you may want to ask when you book your airfare if they will allow you to carry on your dress and\/or give you special considerations.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;starchild&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Alaska Airlines was the best! They put my dress in the empty first class closet, announced us to the whole plane, gave us free champagne, and went around and got advice from married couples then announced it on the PA.....it was above what we expected for sure!!\n \n If you call they&#039;ll say it&#039;s on a space available basis, but if the closets are full you can still carry it on, you&#039;ll just have to lay it flat in the overhead which isn&#039;t a big problem.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Great stories! I&#039;ll cross my fingers and hope I come home with a story like that. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":86271,"PostDate":1186019971,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>gkashmira<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I walked right onto an American Airlines flight with no problem at all. I called ahead of time and they told me just to carry it on and ask to hang it in the front coat closet.<br \/> <br \/> In fact by doing this we also brought it to the stewardess' attention and later they moved us to first class... I swear I'm carrying a large white garment bag whenever I travel - even if it's empty! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>host<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">not only did the airline let me carry on my dress, but they treated me like a VIP and let me board the airplane first and put my dress in the locker for the stewardesses\/pilots.<br \/> <br \/> i dont think there is a list of airlines that will have something this specific but you may want to ask when you book your airfare if they will allow you to carry on your dress and\/or give you special considerations.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>starchild<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Alaska Airlines was the best! They put my dress in the empty first class closet, announced us to the whole plane, gave us free champagne, and went around and got advice from married couples then announced it on the PA.....it was above what we expected for sure!!<br \/> <br \/> If you call they'll say it's on a space available basis, but if the closets are full you can still carry it on, you'll just have to lay it flat in the overhead which isn't a big problem.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Great stories! I'll cross my fingers and hope I come home with a story like that. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong>~ Jaime & Martin ~<\/strong><br><strong>\"Rain or Swine! 2-0-0-9\"<\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong>We had 24 people attend our wedding in Las Caletas, Mexico on May 24th, 2009!<\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong>We all stayed at The Marriott in P.V., and Honeymooned at The Royal Plantation in Ochos Rios, Jamaica<\/strong><span>!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jlm6873@exchange.uta.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174152000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207260.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaimeLynne","Id":207260,"Name":"JaimeLynne","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":86,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
