{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de1a2e83baee8499c3424655756405a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m nervous about carrying it on! We are flying Frontier and I&amp;nbsp;am debating on folding it and putting it in my carry on, or carrying it on in a garmet bag. Anyone have any tips?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1735503,"PostDate":1363654439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm nervous about carrying it on! We are flying Frontier and I\u00a0am debating on folding it and putting it in my carry on, or carrying it on in a garmet bag. Anyone have any tips?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susiesell1982@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358197358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264441.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"susiesell","Id":264441,"Name":"susiesell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f9bd12050ab3d6be35bf58652f542dc","RawContent":"I flew frontier- I just kept my dress in the garmet bag that my dress came in.  We just put it in an empty overhead compartment- no problems! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]susiesell[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m nervous about carrying it on! We are flying Frontier and I am debating on folding it and putting it in my carry on, or carrying it on in a garmet bag. Anyone have any tips?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1735586,"PostDate":1363689565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I flew frontier- I just kept my dress in the garmet bag that my dress came in.\u00a0 We just put it in an empty overhead compartment- no problems!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>susiesell<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm nervous about carrying it on! We are flying Frontier and I\u00a0am debating on folding it and putting it in my carry on, or carrying it on in a garmet bag. Anyone have any tips?\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294245874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1571c587836afd8d30061fc362707732","RawContent":"Thanks Shan! Did you also have a carry on or just your dress?","Attachments":[],"Id":1735742,"PostDate":1363701102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Shan! Did you also have a carry on or just your dress?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susiesell1982@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358197358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264441.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"susiesell","Id":264441,"Name":"susiesell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a46837c6457ca50cdf3ed64ef4a9ff94","RawContent":"I had my dress as my carry on plus a tote that I shoved my purse in just in case they said something but they didn&#039;t so you should be fine with a carryon, the dress and your purse! :) [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]susiesell[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Thanks Shan! Did you also have a carry on or just your dress?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1735781,"PostDate":1363704031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I had my dress as my carry on plus a tote that I shoved my purse in just in case they said something but they didn't so you should be fine with a carryon, the dress and your purse! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>susiesell<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thanks Shan! Did you also have a carry on or just your dress?<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294245874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"949cdbef6cfa4a032de6118f16e0fa44","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Did anyone have a bigger dress? Mine isnt ballroom its mermaid\/trumpte but the bottom&amp;nbsp; is def on the bigger side and I am nervous its too big for a carry on?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1744768,"PostDate":1365773031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did anyone have a bigger dress? Mine isnt ballroom its mermaid\/trumpte but the bottom\u00a0 is def on the bigger side and I am nervous its too big for a carry on?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danayjauregui@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.176.38.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1306853537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240613.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sophia2616","Id":240613,"Name":"Sophia2616","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec872c4dd65803fa60643569509ba770","RawContent":"My dress was a decent size. a) because I&#039;m a big girl and b) it&#039;s an a-line with a train. If it fits in the usual dress shop bridal bag, it should be fine.  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Sophia2616[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Did anyone have a bigger dress? Mine isnt ballroom its mermaid\/trumpte but the bottom  is def on the bigger side and I am nervous its too big for a carry on?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1744893,"PostDate":1365798166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My dress was a decent size. a) because I'm a big girl and <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/> it's an a-line with a train. If it fits in the usual dress shop bridal bag, it should be fine.\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sophia2616<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Did anyone have a bigger dress? Mine isnt ballroom its mermaid\/trumpte but the bottom\u00a0 is def on the bigger side and I am nervous its too big for a carry on?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\"  style=\"display:none\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49c6272a311988859a05cb8c0213db69","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AllieH[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n My dress was a decent size. a) because I&#039;m a big girl and b) it&#039;s an a-line with a train. If it fits in the usual dress shop bridal bag, it should be fine.  \n \n[\/quote]  \n Thanks!!! Yeah it fits in the bag that teh stroe gave me in...fingers crossed!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1745536,"PostDate":1366045149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n          