{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d75d180bbff3ac0ec8671181e0a469fe","RawContent":"I have never heard of anyone having a problem carrying a wedding dress on! Most of the time they do give you an upgrade and treat you VIP but good luck to everyone! :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1747574,"PostDate":1366191955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have never heard of anyone having a problem carrying a wedding dress on! Most of the time they do give you an upgrade and treat you VIP but good luck to everyone! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jburress@westliberty.edu","IpAddress":"76.120.130.115","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1356882528,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263660.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jburress21","Id":263660,"Name":"jburress21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1aec81e6a092239468696e85bceb92c5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That would be nice wouldnt it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1747710,"PostDate":1366208468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That would be nice wouldnt it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danayjauregui@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.176.38.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1306853537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240613.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sophia2616","Id":240613,"Name":"Sophia2616","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7046fd141c24e2c90102efb23581925","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Anyone have any experience with Jetblue?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1752042,"PostDate":1367243383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Anyone have any experience with Jetblue?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trivera5521@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.217.220.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1293377163,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234808.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trivera5521","Id":234808,"Name":"trivera5521","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d35823d29e8e67c394cdeec9259d02d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I flew American and had two flights to get to Jamaica. The first flight from LA to Miami was a pretty big plane and they let me store it in the pilot&#039;s closet. Plus they were super nice to us for the whole flight! No upgrade unfortunately as the flight was full. Oh well. The second flight from Miami to Jamaica was a smaller plane so there wasn&#039;t a closet, just hangers at the back of first class. But I was able to hang it there no problem. I wasn&#039;t too worried about it getting wrinkled because the hotel also steamed and pressed my dress when we arrived. It all worked out!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1753671,"PostDate":1367503997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I flew American and had two flights to get to Jamaica. The first flight from LA to Miami was a pretty big plane and they let me store it in the pilot's closet. Plus they were super nice to us for the whole flight! No upgrade unfortunately as the flight was full. Oh well. The second flight from Miami to Jamaica was a smaller plane so there wasn't a closet, just hangers at the back of first class. But I was able to hang it there no problem. I wasn't too worried about it getting wrinkled because the hotel also steamed and pressed my dress when we arrived. It all worked out!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexismmoore@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.231.22.147","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1337119161,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":667,"PhotoHeight":1000,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alexisinjamaica","Id":255437,"Name":"alexisinjamaica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"082c6c0b09ff377237f67911ba68cecd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; This sounds crazy - but I am actually looking forward to carrying my dress onto the plane just because they usually do give you the VIP treatment :) I&#039;m hoping that is my case at least!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1753888,"PostDate":1367527686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This sounds crazy - but I am actually looking forward to carrying my dress onto the plane just because they usually do give you the VIP treatment <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm hoping that is my case at least!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kgtc.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362498152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266932.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tristanc","Id":266932,"Name":"tristanc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9d581c690fd3e0b3c7aa4bd847e937c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am flying United.... we were able to upgrade our tickets to first class....with miles etc.... &amp;nbsp;but before upgrading... I called they advised me to get to the gate early and let them know I had my wedding dress. &amp;nbsp;There is a closet in first class and they most likely will accomodate!! &amp;nbsp;Also FYI &amp;nbsp;Jet Blue doesn&#039;t have a closet! &amp;nbsp;so overhead bin only.... Hope that helps&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also no baggage fees in first class for two checked bags each! &amp;nbsp;awesome for all your diy projects!!! avoids shipping fees for all of that and favors!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1753904,"PostDate":1367529967,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am flying United.... we were able to upgrade our tickets to first class....with miles etc.... \u00a0but before upgrading... I called they advised me to get to the gate early and let them know I had my wedding dress. \u00a0There is a closet in first class and they most likely will accomodate!! \u00a0Also FYI \u00a0Jet Blue doesn't have a closet! \u00a0so overhead bin only.... Hope that helps<\/p> <p> Also no baggage fees in first class for two checked bags each! \u00a0awesome for all your diy projects!!! avoids shipping fees for all of that and favors!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kel123073@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.5.240.39","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333036206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253364.jpg?_r=1389580952","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kel123073","Id":253364,"Name":"Kel123073","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2449c180b891814ac71b9a01952781ed","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Kel123073[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am flying United.... we were able to upgrade our tickets to first class....with miles etc....  but before upgrading... I called they advised me to get to the gate early and let them know I had my wedding dress.  There is a closet in first class and they most likely will accomodate!!  Also FYI  Jet Blue doesn&#039;t have a closet!  so overhead bin only.... Hope that helps \n Also no baggage fees in first class for two checked bags each!  awesome for all your diy projects!!! avoids shipping fees for all of that and favors![\/quote] \n Great tip on the baggage fees - I forgot that first class gets that as well! Although - I\"ll probably still have to ship some stuff. The laterns and garden stakes might not make a plane trip ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1753910,"PostDate":1367530562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Kel123073<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am flying United.... we were able to upgrade our tickets to first class....with miles etc.... \u00a0but before upgrading... I called they advised me to get to the gate early and let them know I had my wedding dress. \u00a0There is a closet in first class and they most likely will accomodate!! \u00a0Also FYI \u00a0Jet Blue doesn't have a closet! \u00a0so overhead bin only.... Hope that helps<\/p> <p> Also no baggage fees in first class for two checked bags each! \u00a0awesome for all your diy projects!!! avoids shipping fees for all of that and favors!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Great tip on the baggage fees - I forgot that first class gets that as well! Although - I\"ll probably still have to ship some stuff. The laterns and garden stakes might not make a plane trip <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kgtc.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362498152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266932.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tristanc","Id":266932,"Name":"tristanc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe1a3f83c9c3d4cbd442bbc93a5c4e8a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; the garden stakes might be a problem...maybe not if you check them....lol bags are 70lbs each on united also! &amp;nbsp;Another tip from my Aunt was to get a United Chase Card....and rack up miles this year which I did! &amp;nbsp;and first bag checked for free when checking in with that card!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1753920,"PostDate":1367531213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> the garden stakes might be a problem...maybe not if you check them....lol bags are 70lbs each on united also! \u00a0Another tip from my Aunt was to get a United Chase Card....and rack up miles this year which I did! \u00a0and first bag checked for free when checking in with that card!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kel123073@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.5.240.39","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333036206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253364.jpg?_r=1389580952","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kel123073","Id":253364,"Name":"Kel123073","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f0c51c6211184d8ed72d4785292ab47","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Kel123073[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n the garden stakes might be a problem...maybe not if you check them....lol bags are 70lbs each on united also!  Another tip from my Aunt was to get a United Chase Card....and rack up miles this year which I did!  and first bag checked for free when checking in with that card![\/quote] \n \n That&#039;s a good idea too! I hesitate to open a cc though - we might try to buy a house in the near future and don&#039;t want that on my\/our credit report. Something to think about though...thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1754121,"PostDate":1367587162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Kel123073<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> the garden stakes might be a problem...maybe not if you check them....lol bags are 70lbs each on united also! \u00a0Another tip from my Aunt was to get a United Chase Card....and rack up miles this year which I did! \u00a0and first bag checked for free when checking in with that card!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> That's a good idea too! I hesitate to open a cc though - we might try to buy a house in the near future and don't want that on my\/our credit report. Something to think about though...thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kgtc.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362498152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266932.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tristanc","Id":266932,"Name":"tristanc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b967cf7fb10667a2d43b7ff8e91c225e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank heavens for this thread. I have been thinking about this topic lately and freaking out because I have no idea what to do. This has really helped.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1767148,"PostDate":1370993491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank heavens for this thread. I have been thinking about this topic lately and freaking out because I have no idea what to do. This has really helped.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>I am excited to marry the most loving man I have ever met and to become part of his amazing family.<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"totorowtt@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"146.233.0.201","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1368385189,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269521.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe2014","Id":269521,"Name":"Bridetobe2014","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":86,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
