llow the dress as carry on. I was very nervous about checking mine in so I made sure before committing to an airline.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850137,"PostDate":1400002956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>we're booked with Transat leaving from Toronto and they allow the dress as carry on. I was very nervous about checking mine in so I made sure before committing to an airline.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"salehisarvin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.238.64.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398960993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SSarvi","Id":277805,"Name":"SSarvi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.40.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ea595737653dc199636888a65c3c0ad","RawContent":"Has anyone tried to carry their dress on with air Canada?\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1854204,"PostDate":1402074603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anyone tried to carry their dress on with air Canada?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseapjohnson@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.72.57.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361480068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chelseapaige37","Id":266402,"Name":"chelseapaige37","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.40.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e6ca6c2df6b4bcaf62e05f989cb11a3","RawContent":"I&#039;ve never heard of an airline that DOESNT allow brides to carry on their dress. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1854218,"PostDate":1402085387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've never heard of an airline that DOESNT allow brides to carry on their dress. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.152.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d35869496cf517b548ce1ce7e8f4d79","RawContent":"My fianc\u00e9 brought up in conversation with someone the other day that I over heard about checking my dress.... I told him he was insane dress comes with me on board !! It was funny and cute at same time that he was concerned about my dress lol \n\n\nBut I believe every airline allows it?","Attachments":[],"Id":1854354,"PostDate":1402257657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My fianc\u00e9 brought up in conversation with someone the other day that I over heard about checking my dress.... I told him he was insane dress comes with me on board !! It was funny and cute at same time that he was concerned about my dress lol <br><br>\nBut I believe every airline allows it? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>55 guests booked plus bride and groom <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>","Email":"drkt0010@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.101.144.156","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396294378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277431.jpg?_r=1423500629","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dreamteam17","Id":277431,"Name":"Dreamteam17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e2763c711ca63318f9bb7d1380f5eee","RawContent":"I think most airlines allow you to bring your dress as a carry on at the very leaat","Attachments":[],"Id":1855836,"PostDate":1403032736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think most airlines allow you to bring your dress as a carry on at the very leaat\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taryn_henderson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402938094,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tarynh86","Id":278544,"Name":"tarynh86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.239.152.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f7a6ac5e9449f8eff9dbf16802a56ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know if Thomsons will hang it even if you aren&#039;t flying first class? We&#039;re going to be on a Dreamliner so I presume they have loads of closet space, but what do you do on the coach from the hotel to the resort? Now that&#039;ve decided on my dress I&#039;m super protective of it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864487,"PostDate":1407170494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone know if Thomsons will hang it even if you aren't flying first class? We're going to be on a Dreamliner so I presume they have loads of closet space, but what do you do on the coach from the hotel to the resort? Now that've decided on my dress I'm super protective of it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahcoalier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"92.239.152.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402327663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NotSoWitty","Id":278362,"Name":"NotSoWitty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.196.37.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"216c37c8621cc62e37e889946f193489","RawContent":"@[member=\"NotSoWitty\"]. I&#039;m on the Dreamliner too with thomsons and I&#039;m sure it&#039;ll get hung somewhere or there will be somewhere specific. As for the transfer we have a limo which is our transfer from airport which came with out package so I&#039;m assuming there will be somewhere as It will only be the two of us in the car","Attachments":[],"Id":1864500,"PostDate":1407174894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278362\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278362-notsowitty\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NotSoWitty<\/span><\/a>. I'm on the Dreamliner too with thomsons and I'm sure it'll get hung somewhere or there will be somewhere specific. As for the transfer we have a limo which is our transfer from airport which came with out package so I'm assuming there will be somewhere as It will only be the two of us in the car \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390383454,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68870ac56cd354d9d6806ffefae2ec5e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does the dress count as a carryon, for instance if a flight allows 2 carryons, can you only bring a small suitcase and dress, or are there any airlines where you could do small suitcase, backpack, and dress?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866813,"PostDate":1408116067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does the dress count as a carryon, for instance if a flight allows 2 carryons, can you only bring a small suitcase and dress, or are there any airlines where you could do small suitcase, backpack, and dress?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406722272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,