{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.233.153.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3e36c2af781e3d6822914da82f4d59c","RawContent":"Thanks everyone! Can&#039;t wait to bring my wedding dress on a plane and hopefully recieve v.i.p treatment :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1866999,"PostDate":1408180052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks everyone! Can't wait to bring my wedding dress on a plane and hopefully recieve v.i.p treatment <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>The Future Mrs. Santos\u00a0<\/b>","Email":"tljubainville@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.233.153.252","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408010816,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279435.jpg?_r=1409501389","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Tiffany1221","Id":279435,"Name":"Tiffany1221","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.239.152.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43b4a2ba84a746acd1f1c95a37b82033","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Pablou\" post=\"1864500\" timestamp=\"1407189294\"]\n@[member=\"NotSoWitty\"]. I&#039;m on the Dreamliner too with thomsons and I&#039;m sure it&#039;ll get hung somewhere or there will be somewhere specific. As for the transfer we have a limo which is our transfer from airport which came with out package so I&#039;m assuming there will be somewhere as It will only be the two of us in the car[\/quote]Thanks! How did you arrange the limo transfer? Was it through the TA? I&#039;m planning on asking a million questions when we go in to pay the rest of the amount. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1867855,"PostDate":1408547332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Pablou, on 04 August 2014 - 05:54 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278362\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278362-notsowitty\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NotSoWitty<\/span><\/a>. I'm on the Dreamliner too with thomsons and I'm sure it'll get hung somewhere or there will be somewhere specific. As for the transfer we have a limo which is our transfer from airport which came with out package so I'm assuming there will be somewhere as It will only be the two of us in the car<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks! How did you arrange the limo transfer? Was it through the TA? I'm planning on asking a million questions when we go in to pay the rest of the amount. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahcoalier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"92.239.152.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402327663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NotSoWitty","Id":278362,"Name":"NotSoWitty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.203.151.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e02f206c57cd5d8219f8abf8b2dcb728","RawContent":"Hey. @[member=\"NotSoWitty\"] When we booked everything through thomsons the ta just said that that came with our booking. We didn&#039;t Nd to ask for it. The rest of our wedding party is on a mini coach and we have the limo. Ask your ta about it to see what they say","Attachments":[],"Id":1867969,"PostDate":1408594974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278362\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278362-notsowitty\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NotSoWitty<\/span><\/a> When we booked everything through thomsons the ta just said that that came with our booking. We didn't Nd to ask for it. The rest of our wedding party is on a mini coach and we have the limo. Ask your ta about it to see what they say \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390383454,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.47.49.223","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c24d211b97b1298759b826ade455b4f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing everyone. &amp;nbsp;I plan on bringing my dress on as a carry-on. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868580,"PostDate":1408907827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing everyone. \u00a0I plan on bringing my dress on as a carry-on. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolie.vidal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408543857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideToBeJolie","Id":279500,"Name":"BrideToBeJolie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.232.231.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"954023a4e7848af8273d0ad28f0a03cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married in July 2016 which airline has a closet where I can hang my dress?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907587,"PostDate":1447619015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married in July 2016 which airline has a closet where I can hang my dress?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"traecyn@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.183.60.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422114328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nickylynch","Id":281853,"Name":"Nickylynch","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.235.107.159","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":5164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50b5072e63517ab62bad7553ba2e6365","RawContent":"The owner of the bridal shop where I got my dress also suggested to bring your dress on as a carry-on instead of as checked luggage. She said it&#039;s better to pack it in a suitcase rather than use the garment bag. She mentioned that most of the garment bags are or very cheap quality. She is willing to pack my dress for me which is nice. I assume the gown would be easier to maneuver through busy airports with it being in a carry-on luggage than having to hold the garment bag throughout the airport. It would be nice to get the first class upgrade and the champagne as mentioned.","Attachments":[],"Id":1910870,"PostDate":1455493851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The owner of the bridal shop where I got my dress also suggested to bring your dress on as a carry-on instead of as checked luggage. She said it's better to pack it in a suitcase rather than use the garment bag. She mentioned that most of the garment bags are or very cheap quality. She is willing to pack my dress for me which is nice. I assume the gown would be easier to maneuver through busy airports with it being in a carry-on luggage than having to hold the garment bag throughout the airport. It would be nice to get the first class upgrade and the champagne as mentioned.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rhonda3839@aol.com","IpAddress":"32.214.84.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433621117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283419.jpg?_r=1456626300","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Rhonda3839","Id":283419,"Name":"Rhonda3839","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":86,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
