{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e2ddeac570c8b98be7af7612c6510f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I was wondering how everyone is transporting their dress to Hawaii?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248025,"PostDate":1281387154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was wondering how everyone is transporting their dress to Hawaii?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gagnon.nicole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1279931258,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230608.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ngagnon","Id":230608,"Name":"ngagnon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90cbf5e888c905e18d054c858a8b5df9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My wedding dress shop told me to bring in the biggest hand luggage case you are allowed to bring on the plane, and they will pack it for us in that. They do it all the time so they know the best way to get it in without messing it up. Maybe ask yours?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251945,"PostDate":1281629417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My wedding dress shop told me to bring in the biggest hand luggage case you are allowed to bring on the plane, and they will pack it for us in that. They do it all the time so they know the best way to get it in without messing it up. Maybe ask yours?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"claire_cittern@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1250454082,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220599.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"clairelouise","Id":220599,"Name":"clairelouise","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73fe1740179e8fcbe6d1e6f7320fbb13","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the information&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253065,"PostDate":1281709780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the information<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gagnon.nicole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1279931258,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230608.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ngagnon","Id":230608,"Name":"ngagnon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f278468719f654b96991c37e1cbe2940","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I bought a garment bag that folded (search for: Wally Garment Bags) and it worked PERFECT. It held my dress, veil, TTD, and hubs&#039;s suit. And it folded so that it remained within the airlines size requirements. The airline attendants let us hang it in the first class cabin closet at full length too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1256475,"PostDate":1282056713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I bought a garment bag that folded (search for: Wally Garment Bags) and it worked PERFECT. It held my dress, veil, TTD, and hubs's suit. And it folded so that it remained within the airlines size requirements. The airline attendants let us hang it in the first class cabin closet at full length too.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tovaqqqq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238681712,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bridetov","Id":216386,"Name":"bridetov","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20c1524b1ccb01e44436bfb78b9cc40b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; There are several Wally Garment Bags...which one did you get?&amp;nbsp; &lt;img height=\"1\" src=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/images\/spacer.gif\" width=\"1\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"184\"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt; &lt;img height=\"29\" src=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/images\/menu\/allproducts-title.jpg\" width=\"184\" \/&gt;&lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td background=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/images\/menu\/centerbg.jpg\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"arrowlistmenu\"&gt; &lt;h3 class=\"menuheader expandable openheader\" headerindex=\"0h\"&gt; Everyday&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;ul class=\"categoryitems\" contentindex=\"0c\" style=\"display: block;\"&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/collection.php?cid=1\"&gt;Entire Collection&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"htt