 <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> There are several Wally Garment Bags...which one did you get?\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"1\" src=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/images\/spacer.gif\" width=\"1\" \/><\/span><\/p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"184\"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"29\" src=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/images\/menu\/allproducts-title.jpg\" width=\"184\" \/><\/span><\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td background=\"http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/images\/menu\/centerbg.jpg\"> <div class=\"arrowlistmenu\"> <h3 class=\"menuheader expandable openheader\" headerindex=\"0h\"> Everyday<\/h3> <ul class=\"categoryitems\" contentindex=\"0c\" style=\"display: block;\"> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/collection.php?cid=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Entire Collection<\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 600<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">Garment Covers<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=2' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 700<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">Garment Bags with Handles<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 800<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">Garment Bags with Pockets<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=4' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 800LC<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">Large Capacity Garment Bags<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=5' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 900<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">One Pocket Garment Bags<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=6' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 1800\/2200<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">Shoulder Strap Garment Bags<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=7' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 500<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">GarmenTote\u00ae Tri-Fold<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.wallybags.com\/products\/mainproduct.php?seriesid=8' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Series 3500<br \/> <span class=\"desc\">Framed Tri-Fold<\/span> <\/a><\/li> <\/ul> <\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/tbody> <\/table>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbockman3@al.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1279676455,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230480.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrs.S2B","Id":230480,"Name":"Mrs.S2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2362c0a500dd71881672cd3a8068b010","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It was this one:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.ebags.com\/product\/wally-bags\/52-dress-bag\/93250?productid=1232672\"&gt;http:\/\/www.ebags.com\/product\/wally-bags\/52-dress-bag\/93250?productid=1232672&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Plenty roomy enough, fit airline requirements, durable and easy to carry. I ended up selling mine to another DW bride for her upcoming wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1257821,"PostDate":1282135656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It was this one:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.ebags.com\/product\/wally-bags\/52-dress-bag\/93250?productid=1232672' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ebags.com...oductid=1232672<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Plenty roomy enough, fit airline requirements, durable and easy to carry. I ended up selling mine to another DW bride for her upcoming wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tovaqqqq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238681712,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bridetov","Id":216386,"Name":"bridetov","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fb5eedc1db383f40db7069e2a4bc19a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I packed mine in my suitecase.&amp;nbsp; I already arranged to have it steamed at Ellys formal wear so I didnt worry.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1309979,"PostDate":1286843522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I packed mine in my suitecase.\u00a0 I already arranged to have it steamed at Ellys formal wear so I didnt worry.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cnjames2211@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1266217688,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225607.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cnjames2211","Id":225607,"Name":"cnjames2211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40371804e4609601cb6a72ce1812e1c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I packed mine in the suitcase, as well. My wedding dress had a huge train, so no matter how I transported the dress, I knew I would need to have it steam pressed professionally. We stayed at Sugar Beach Resort in Kihei and Ellys Formal Wear was just a few steps away from our condo, so it worked out perfectly. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1316530,"PostDate":1287545148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I packed mine in the suitcase, as well. My wedding dress had a huge train, so no matter how I transported the dress, I knew I would need to have it steam pressed professionally. We stayed at Sugar Beach Resort in Kihei and Ellys Formal Wear was just a few steps away from our condo, so it worked out perfectly. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashimamehtani@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1279998784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230622.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SHeeMz","Id":230622,"Name":"SHeeMz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"475c0a9bcdd4b017a303d1919fdec569","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; my bridal boutique said to bring a case and they will pack it for me :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just have to hang it up in its carry case when we get there&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1316623,"PostDate":1287568087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> my bridal boutique said to bring a case and they will pack it for me :-)<\/p> <p> I just have to hang it up in its carry case when we get there<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/yorkieswedding.blogspot.com\">http:\/\/yorkieswedding.blogspot.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sallyblackham@googlemail.com","IpAddress":"176.252.249.136","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284469814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232332.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sallee","Id":232332,"Name":"Sallee","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
