Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffacec73fa4d8df1952dd2679dab0547","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married at the Grand Oasis Marien in April and my fiance is worried about her wedding dress arriving wrinkled. How have you prevented it being crushed? Should we have it pressed before we leave? The resort isn&#039;t able to do it at their laundry. Any advice or help would be greatly appreciated, especially by my fiance! Thanks! :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1057594,"PostDate":1267549943,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married at the Grand Oasis Marien in April and my fiance is worried about her wedding dress arriving wrinkled. How have you prevented it being crushed? Should we have it pressed before we leave? The resort isn't able to do it at their laundry. Any advice or help would be greatly appreciated, especially by my fiance! Thanks! :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cfthunderbird@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1253544629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cfthunder","Id":221844,"Name":"Cfthunder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1cc40e4f8aaa82ff4b6da1d5cc619e30","RawContent":"I packed mine in a 22&amp;quot; rolling carry on. It was over the top wrinkled when we got there. I had hoped I could just hang it for a few days and it would be fine, but over a couple days no improvements were seen. I ended up emailing my friend who hadn&#039;t traveled yet and asked him to pick up a travel streamer at Target. He did and it really maded a huge difference. We steamed my dress, the bridesmaid dresses, groomsmen shirts and pants... and I&#039;m pretty sure a few other things the day of the wedding. It is about the size of a hair dryer. \n \n So depending on what type of fabric, I think that&#039;s a pretty easy option.","Attachments":[],"Id":1057615,"PostDate":1267550394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I packed mine in a 22\" rolling carry on. It was over the top wrinkled when we got there. I had hoped I could just hang it for a few days and it would be fine, but over a couple days no improvements were seen. I ended up emailing my friend who hadn't traveled yet and asked him to pick up a travel streamer at Target. He did and it really maded a huge difference. We steamed my dress, the bridesmaid dresses, groomsmen shirts and pants... and I'm pretty sure a few other things the day of the wedding. It is about the size of a hair dryer. <br \/> <br \/> So depending on what type of fabric, I think that's a pretty easy option.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k_j_p23@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1254239706,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222118.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"riokayak","Id":222118,"Name":"riokayak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d92735331ebefc985499e9faaba58ffb","RawContent":"Honestly i dont know if you can really prevent it from getting wrinkled &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;. Depending on the fabric of your dress the more or less wrinkled it will get. You can however ask the FA to see if there is a whole open cabinet where you can lay your dress out in half and if your lucky(i wasn&#039;t) and your plane has a coat hanger then try and place it there :)... Also try a HOT shower to steam it out..","Attachments":[],"Id":1057637,"PostDate":1267550827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Honestly i dont know if you can really prevent it from getting wrinkled <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>. Depending on the fabric of your dress the more or less wrinkled it will get. You can however ask the FA to see if there is a whole open cabinet where you can lay your dress out in half and if your lucky(i wasn't) and your plane has a coat hanger then try and place it there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>... Also try a HOT shower to steam it out..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kuteliya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1240858098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217092.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"**~Linda~**","Id":217092,"Name":"**~Linda~**","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7723b1d062bcdb54eb26a639b8e0d68","RawContent":"I am planning to take it in a garment bag and hopefully be able to hang it in the plain. And if I cant do what the girls above me suggested, leave it to hang in the bathroom or bring a travel steamer.","Attachments":[],"Id":1057693,"PostDate":1267552118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am planning to take it in a garment bag and hopefully be able to hang it in the plain. And if I cant do what the girls above me suggested, leave it to hang in the bathroom or bring a travel steamer.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/O3XEm5.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/O3XEm5.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wGKxufD\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ufD\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/destinationwedding5000.blogspot.com\/\">My $5000 Wedding Blog<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"luciel2820@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246148511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218870.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"luciel2820","Id":218870,"Name":"luciel2820","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd300f6d388dd14a94155c26b86ff7d2","RawContent":"A lot of flight attendants did whatever they could to be accommodating towards my dress. It helped that it was obviously a wedding dress I suppose as the garment bag from the bridal shop was pink lol. When there wasn&#039;t an open closet to place it in they helped find a storage bin where it would fit nicely over the luggage inside without having to fold it. We got to Maui and it still looked great!\n It was pressed before we left. I agree with the other girls though, it may depend on the fabric!","Attachments":[],"Id":1057723,"PostDate":1267552779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                A lot of flight attendants did whatever they could to be accommodating towards my dress. It helped that it was obviously a wedding dress I suppose as the garment bag from the bridal shop was pink lol. When there wasn't an open closet to place it in they helped find a storage bin where it would fit nicely over the luggage inside without having to fold it. We got to Maui and it still looked great!<br \/> It was pressed before we left. I agree with the other girls though, it may depend on the fabric!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.photobiz.com\/slideshowbiz\/slideshow.cfm?slideshowID=67327&photographerID=1121\">http:\/\/www.photobiz.com\/slideshowbiz...grapherID=1121<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i430.photobucket.com\/albums\/qq24\/litl_april\/Wedding\/JustMarriedTTD.jpg\">http:\/\/i430.photobucket.com\/albums\/q...MarriedTTD.jpg<\/a><strong>April Marie<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"april_berndt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1215711677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210454.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"litl_april","Id":210454,"Name":"litl_april","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5c79540dafd64cd43a89402bdc7dbb5","RawContent":"Thanks everyone, this is all very helpful! I think I might have it professionally pressed before we leave, then carry it in the garment bag on the plane and hope for the best! I&#039;ve already contacted our carrier, they don&#039;t have a closet or anything but I hope to be able to lay it out. The thing I&#039;m most concerned about regarding the steamer is that the dress won&#039;t dry out - because of the humidity, once its steamed, will it stay damp? Is that a silly concern? BTW, the dress is satin with chiffon overlay - the satin is the part I&#039;m concerned about. Has anyone used a steamer in a damp climate with good (and dry!) results?","Attachments":[],"Id":1058403,"PostDate":1267569604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks everyone, this is all very helpful! I think I might have it professionally pressed before we leave, then carry it in the garment bag on the plane and hope for the best! I've already contacted our carrier, they don't have a closet or anything but I hope to be able to lay it out. The thing I'm most concerned about regarding the steamer is that the dress won't dry out - because of the humidity, once its steamed, will it stay damp? Is that a silly concern? BTW, the dress is satin with chiffon overlay - the satin is the part I'm concerned about. Has anyone used a steamer in a damp climate with good (and dry!) results?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cfthunderbird@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1253544629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cfthunder","Id":221844,"Name":"Cfthunder","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90d5d2d3706649f4b9dc7af5f4829eff","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Cfthunder&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks everyone, this is all very helpful! I think I might have it professionally pressed before we leave, then carry it in the garment bag on the plane and hope for the best! I&#039;ve already contacted our carrier, they don&#039;t have a closet or anything but I hope to be able to lay it out. The thing I&#039;m most concerned about regarding the steamer is that the dress won&#039;t dry out - because of the humidity, once its steamed, will it stay damp? Is that a silly concern? BTW, the dress is satin with chiffon overlay - the satin is the part I&#039;m concerned about. Has anyone used a steamer in a damp climate with good (and dry!) results?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I travelled with it in the garment bag. On the plane, they put it in the overhead compartment on top, laying flat. I just hung it up right away once we got there (in the bag) and left it... You should be fine with letting it sit in the steam .... mine was. GOod luck.","Attachments":[],"Id":1058964,"PostDate":1267589362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Cfthunder<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks everyone, this is all very helpful! I think I might have it professionally pressed before we leave, then carry it in the garment bag on the plane and hope for the best! I've already contacted our carrier, they don't have a closet or anything but I hope to be able to lay it out. The thing I'm most concerned about regarding the steamer is that the dress won't dry out - because of the humidity, once its steamed, will it stay damp? Is that a silly concern? BTW, the dress is satin with chiffon overlay - the satin is the part I'm concerned about. Has anyone used a steamer in a damp climate with good (and dry!) results?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I travelled with it in the garment bag. On the plane, they put it in the overhead compartment on top, laying flat. I just hung it up right away once we got there (in the bag) and left it... You should be fine with letting it sit in the steam .... mine was. GOod luck.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20100120\/e\/on+my+way+to+being+mrs+L\/k\/e51f\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e51f\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tamtret@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1249049949,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tam","Id":220034,"Name":"Tam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f886657172253030b3b56744988b237f","RawContent":"Thanks for all the great suggestions","Attachments":[],"Id":1075114,"PostDate":1268606863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all the great suggestions\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\"><br \/>\n[IMG]http:\/\/sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash2\/hs014.ash2\/34045_1507391727839_1325681535_1627159_1121245_n.j pg[\/IMG<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/nlp8wi.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/nlp8wi.png<\/a><br \/>\n<span>For it was not into my ear you whispered, but into my heart.It was not my lips you kissed, but my soul.-Judy GarlandBride and...<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/photos-g.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-snc1\/hs132.snc1\/5654_1189811588534_1325681535_796850_3095915_s.jpg\"><\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kate_hephner@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231306527,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213670.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kate&devon","Id":213670,"Name":"kate&devon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1add9c9dbbe95fb655d5cc9e1f3efc8","RawContent":"I&#039;m bringing it in a garmet bag as my carry on luggage. I called the airline and they said they do not have coat racks or any place to put it but I&#039;m hoping once I&#039;m on the plane a flight attendant will be able to find a spot for it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1075229,"PostDate":1268612859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm bringing it in a garmet bag as my carry on luggage. I called the airline and they said they do not have coat racks or any place to put it but I'm hoping once I'm on the plane a flight attendant will be able to find a spot for it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"missmcgov@verizon.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246406128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218978.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Laur13","Id":218978,"Name":"Laur13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53ff28bd9caa250da80d7ac7e50fc1a0","RawContent":"Bringing my dress as a carry on in a garmet bag. If its really wrinkled when I arrive I will pay for it to get steamed at the resort. Most resorts do this.","Attachments":[],"Id":1075282,"PostDate":1268614793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Bringing my dress as a carry on in a garmet bag. If its really wrinkled when I arrive I will pay for it to get steamed at the resort. Most resorts do this.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10722;0\/st\/20100525\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-3\/k\/d780\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...d780\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jackies0022@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1257546254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223123.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jackie22","Id":223123,"Name":"Jackie22","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":29,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
