  font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just booked my hair\/makeup with a Canadian makeup artist who will be in PC for the winter. \u00a0Her name is Krystie Ann, you can find her on FB (search Krystie An Hair & Makeup Artist). \u00a0Her portfolio is awesome, her prices are reasonable, and she's been really responsive and easy to work with so far. \u00a0I'm so excited to have found someone in Punta Cana.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslieeustice@att.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321469790,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lande8","Id":247750,"Name":"lande8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aceeee01230aabab1a285d7a03bdab9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I wonder how the resort stylists are? I&#039;m nervous about not knwoing the quality until I get there...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1648141,"PostDate":1343844524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n          