re":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.158.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4953d66f98eae3416f4202a7291b7442","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m leaning very close to it. It seems to be less expensive then the resort. And, the pictures I&#039;ve seen are amazing. How&#039;s your planning going?@[member=\"tasha682\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842489,"PostDate":1396606548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm leaning very close to it. It seems to be less expensive then the resort. And, the pictures I've seen are amazing. How's your planning going?@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276305\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276305-tasha682\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tasha682<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.163.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"886f310de92a83f386222009b435b346","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] Its going good. I had foot surgery so I have been off work the past 2 weeks which has given me a lot of time to look at wedding stuff!!!&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have pretty much paid all my deposits (Kukua, make up, photo\/video) so now I just have to make decor selections, get invitations, decide on menu and dress. All the fun stuff! lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Its so hard to do favor type stuff until you know your exact # of guests&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842495,"PostDate":1396607265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> Its going good. I had foot surgery so I have been off work the past 2 weeks which has given me a lot of time to look at wedding stuff!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have pretty much paid all my deposits (Kukua, make up, photo\/video) so now I just have to make decor selections, get invitations, decide on menu and dress. All the fun stuff! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Its so hard to do favor type stuff until you know your exact # of guests<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tasha682@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.163.64.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390519251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276305.jpg?_r=1396380414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tasha682","Id":276305,"Name":"tasha682","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32f71a04d696cef477dc9fba5548fdc9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tasha682\"] I have two years to plan. But, I want to start early so in order to try and avoid stress. Lol.... Who&#039;s doing your hair and make-up and video?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842497,"PostDate":1396607436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276305\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276305-tasha682\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tasha682<\/span><\/a> I have two years to plan. But, I want to start early so in order to try and avoid stress. Lol.... Who's doing your hair and make-up and video?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.163.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c093eb388061c6515fcb09fe76d3b9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] I picked HDC Photo for my photo and video. I will be getting 6 hours of each for $2000. Compared to other prices ive seen...you can&#039;t beat that. I love their photo style! One of my guests gf is a bridal make up artists, so I will be using her services for make up. And my hair dresser is also a guest and I will be using her for that.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes do your research early. That will make it enjoyable as oppose to stressful&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842500,"PostDate":1396607930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> I picked HDC Photo for my photo and video. I will be getting 6 hours of each for $2000. Compared to other prices ive seen...you can't beat that. I love their photo style! One of my guests gf is a bridal make up artists, so I will be using her services for make up. And my hair dresser is also a guest and I will be using her for that.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes do your research early. That will make it enjoyable as oppose to stressful\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tasha682@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.163.64.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390519251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276305.jpg?_r=1396380414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Forma