{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"770a4296b1210724b5f6c2ee60b77fff","RawContent":"[quote name=\"colivia\" post=\"1845564\" timestamp=\"1398186026\"]\nThank you so much! The planning is going great. We haven&#039;t chosen a color scheme or anything yet. We have booked our photographer, videographer, sent out save the dates, and almost have our invites ready to print and assemble. That&#039;s all we&#039;ve done so far. I feel like we&#039;ve done a ton more, but on paper it doesn&#039;t look like we&#039;ve done much. haha. Bego has been amazing this far and was very quick to answer the million questions I emailed her. We have chosen Now Larimar as our resort. One of my best friends was married in Punta Cana a little over a year ago. They had their wedding &amp;amp; reception at the Jellyfish, and it was beautiful!! They chose Majestic Elegance as their resort.[\/quote]Yes Bego seems like a dream to work with. I can&#039;t wait to get the ball rolling. I&#039;ve been torn between Now and Kukua. But, I think I&#039;m going to go with Kukua. I want that one on one attention:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1845584,"PostDate":1398177668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>colivia, on 22 April 2014 - 01:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you so much! The planning is going great. We haven't chosen a color scheme or anything yet. We have booked our photographer, videographer, sent out save the dates, and almost have our invites ready to print and assemble. That's all we've done so far. I feel like we've done a ton more, but on paper it doesn't look like we've done much. haha. Bego has been amazing this far and was very quick to answer the million questions I emailed her. We have chosen Now Larimar as our resort. One of my best friends was married in Punta Cana a little over a year ago. They had their wedding & reception at the Jellyfish, and it was beautiful!! They chose Majestic Elegance as their resort.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yes Bego seems like a dream to work with. I can't wait to get the ball rolling. I've been torn between Now and Kukua. But, I think I'm going to go with Kukua. I want that one on one attention:)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b48becc0f38f2109a0fc92849f2366f8","RawContent":"If you want one on one attention and privacy during your wedding then I suggest going with Kukua or another venue off the resort. I&#039;ve seen quite a few weddings at resorts, and they&#039;ve always been set up smack dab in the middle of people laying out on lounge chairs. There&#039;s nothing wrong with that atmosphere, and it doesn&#039;t bother some brides one bit. However, my fianc\u00e9 and I wanted more privacy for our ceremony &amp;amp; reception which is why we are doing it at Kukua. We are paying the extra money to rent the entire venue out for the day. Good luck with decision making!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1845629,"PostDate":1398190144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you want one on one attention and privacy during your wedding then I suggest going with Kukua or another venue off the resort. I've seen quite a few weddings at resorts, and they've always been set up smack dab in the middle of people laying out on lounge chairs. There's nothing wrong with that atmosphere, and it doesn't bother some brides one bit. However, my fianc\u00e9 and I wanted more privacy for our ceremony & reception which is why we are doing it at Kukua. We are paying the extra money to rent the entire venue out for the day. Good luck with decision making!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olivia_colt.murski@outlook.com","IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392674176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276756.jpg?_r=1399903658","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colivia","Id":276756,"Name":"colivia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.174.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2661d7282b80792df6273b37ff2e1206","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I got married here last March 2013 - best day of my life...Bego is amazing!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846009,"PostDate":1398338012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got married here last March 2013 - best day of my life...Bego is amazing!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><em>Bling in Bloom - Floral Brooch Bouquets<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/blinginbloom'><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/blinginbloom<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">blinginbloom@outlook.com<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">@blinginbloom<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">IG: blinginbloom<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1846014]' id='ipb-attach-url-27633-0-10925300-1460853560' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-245252-0-26302500-1398353459.jpg\" title=\"IMG_4232.JPG -  69.91KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-245252-0-26302500-1398353459_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27633-0-10925300-1460853560' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"IMG_4232.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"cindy_cashman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.174.59","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315908199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245252.jpg?_r=1398353899","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cindy2013","Id":245252,"Name":"cindy2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9dd023d60182bbe3e1310d9da09983ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone! I&#039;m getting married in 4 months and am just finding out about this restaurant! I&#039;m in a panic because my resort only wants to serve my guests buffet-style when there are over 50 people! Now I&#039;m panicking with a last minute dinner reception change!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bego has gotten back to me already about the basics and has confirmed that my date is available. Now I just have to figure out A MILLION other things! Hopefully you guys have already figured out some of these questions:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nDoes anyone know how their transport works? Like do they pick up and drop off at the resort only at one specific time?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nIs the club air conditioned?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How long does the reception typically last?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone hired any performers (saxaphonist, fire dancers, etc)? How were they?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Decorations - does Bego provide all of them and charge separately for each item rented, or does she quote a package price for everything you want?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How does the breakdown of the open&amp;nbsp;bar work? Is it like if dinner is from 7-8p then we&#039;d pay $5\/pp for \"dinner drinks\", then from 8-11p we have an international bar at $15\/pp per hr? And if we wanted the open bar throughout dinner and the reception we&#039;d just go 7-11p at $15\/pp per hr?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry for bombarding but we have such a limited time!!! Thanks for your help ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847272,"PostDate":1398771001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone! I'm getting married in 4 months and am just finding out about this restaurant! I'm in a panic because my resort only wants to serve my guests buffet-style when there are over 50 people! Now I'm panicking with a last minute dinner reception change!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bego has gotten back to me already about the basics and has confirmed that my date is available. Now I just have to figure out A MILLION other things! Hopefully you guys have already figured out some of these questions:<\/p>\n<p>\nDoes anyone know how their transport works? Like do they pick up and drop off at the resort only at one specific time?<\/p>\n<p>\nIs the club air conditioned?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How long does the reception typically last?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone hired any performers (saxaphonist, fire dancers, etc)? How were they?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Decorations - does Bego provide all of them and charge separately for each item rented, or does she quote a package price for everything you want?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How does the breakdown of the open\u00a0bar work? Is it like if dinner is from 7-8p then we'd pay $5\/pp for \"dinner drinks\", then from 8-11p we have an international bar at $15\/pp per hr? And if we wanted the open bar throughout dinner and the reception we'd just go 7-11p at $15\/pp per hr?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry for bombarding but we have such a limited time!!! Thanks for your help ladies!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d323a2758854dcaf4a996609918b700e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] Just wanted to let you know that Bego got back to me within a few hours and sent me the info you shared (thanks again) so I already had a ton of questions and ideas of what I wanted. She said she&#039;d have a \"pre invoice\" on Friday for me! So exciting!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks again for your help!&amp;nbsp; I think everything&#039;s gonna fall into place....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847356,"PostDate":1398785803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> Just wanted to let you know that Bego got back to me within a few hours and sent me the info you shared (thanks again) so I already had a ton of questions and ideas of what I wanted. She said she'd have a \"pre invoice\" on Friday for me! So exciting!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks again for your help!\u00a0 I think everything's gonna fall into place....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.210.10.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bf23813f50f187b9710036625c40080","RawContent":"My BFF had fire dancers and cigar rollers at her reception last year. Both were a huge hit with all their guests!!! The fire dancers were awesome!! We plan on having both at our reception as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":1847590,"PostDate":1398860789,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My BFF had fire dancers and cigar rollers at her reception last year. Both were a huge hit with all their guests!!! The fire dancers were awesome!! We plan on having both at our reception as well. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olivia_colt.murski@outlook.com","IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392674176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276756.jpg?_r=1399903658","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colivia","Id":276756,"Name":"colivia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"019b8ca18408654ebf650a9e6c76d5c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cindy2013\"] Do you have pics to share of your wedding at Kukua?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847834,"PostDate":1398951029,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"245252\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/245252-cindy2013\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cindy2013<\/span><\/a> Do you have pics to share of your wedding at Kukua?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.163.64.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85aa6ba1b2a7912db009a83fb493d0f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cindy2013\"] I would love to see pics too! Anything you would have done differently? Or anything you wish you would have known?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847923,"PostDate":1398982756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"245252\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/245252-cindy2013\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cindy2013<\/span><\/a> I would love to see pics too! Anything you would have done differently? Or anything you wish you would have known?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tasha682@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.163.64.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390519251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276305.jpg?_r=1396380414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tasha682","Id":276305,"Name":"tasha682","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.179.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e837dc3ddb1d96a5193d0ae380ab1c7","RawContent":"Just makes it easier to post the link but here is my review of Kukua and Bego.\n\nI would definitely recommend this place to relaxed and easy going brides to be&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g147293-d1747627-r201995162-Kukua_Beach_Club-Punta_Cana_La_Altagracia_Province_Dominican_Republic.html#readReview&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g147293-d1747627-r201995162-Kukua_Beach_Club-Punta_Cana_La_Altagracia_Province_Dominican_Republic.html#readReview&lt;\/a&gt;\n@[member=\"duchovny0901\"]\n\nquote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1847272\" timestamp=\"1398785401\"]Hi everyone! I&#039;m getting married in 4 months and am just finding out about this restaurant! I&#039;m in a panic because my resort only wants to serve my guests buffet-style when there are over 50 people! Now I&#039;m panicking with a last minute dinner reception change!\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nBego has gotten back to me already about the basics and has confirmed that my date is available. Now I just have to figure out A MILLION other things! Hopefully you guys have already figured out some of these questions:\n\n\nDoes anyone know how their transport works? Like do they pick up and drop off at the resort only at one specific time?\n\n\nIs the club air conditioned? No it&#039;s outdoor space.\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nHow long does the reception typically last? As long as you want it to! (If you rent the whole place out I&#039;m sure they stay open later. We stayed until 1130 and didn&#039;t have exclusive use of the place.\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nHas anyone hired any performers (saxaphonist, fire dancers, etc)? How were they?\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nDecorations - does Bego provide all of them and charge separately for each item rented, or does she quote a package price for everything you want? Set up for 50 ppl max is 500 for deco on the beach and 500 for deco for the dinner. She provides everything! \n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nHow does the breakdown of the open&amp;nbsp;bar work? Is it like if dinner is from 7-8p then we&#039;d pay $5\/pp for \"dinner drinks\", then from 8-11p we have an international bar at $15\/pp per hr? And if we wanted the open bar throughout dinner and the reception we&#039;d just go 7-11p at $15\/pp per hr? Exactly. The 8$\/pp for the cocktail hour is what I know of...\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nSorry for bombarding but we have such a limited time!!! Thanks for your help ladies![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1848027,"PostDate":1399046916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just makes it easier to post the link but here is my review of Kukua and Bego.<br>\nI would definitely recommend this place to relaxed and easy going brides to be<a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g147293-d1747627-r201995162-Kukua_Beach_Club-Punta_Cana_La_Altagracia_Province_Dominican_Republic.html#readReview' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tripadvis...html#readReview<\/a><br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270677\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270677-duchovny0901\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">duchovny0901<\/span><\/a><br>\nquote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1847272\" timestamp=\"1398785401\"]Hi everyone! I'm getting married in 4 months and am just finding out about this restaurant! I'm in a panic because my resort only wants to serve my guests buffet-style when there are over 50 people! Now I'm panicking with a last minute dinner reception change!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nBego has gotten back to me already about the basics and has confirmed that my date is available. Now I just have to figure out A MILLION other things! Hopefully you guys have already figured out some of these questions:<br><br>\nDoes anyone know how their transport works? Like do they pick up and drop off at the resort only at one specific time?<br><br>\nIs the club air conditioned? No it's outdoor space.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHow long does the reception typically last? As long as you want it to! (If you rent the whole place out I'm sure they stay open later. We stayed until 1130 and didn't have exclusive use of the place.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHas anyone hired any performers (saxaphonist, fire dancers, etc)? How were they?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nDecorations - does Bego provide all of them and charge separately for each item rented, or does she quote a package price for everything you want? Set up for 50 ppl max is 500 for deco on the beach and 500 for deco for the dinner. She provides everything! <br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHow does the breakdown of the open\u00a0bar work? Is it like if dinner is from 7-8p then we'd pay $5\/pp for \"dinner drinks\", then from 8-11p we have an international bar at $15\/pp per hr? And if we wanted the open bar throughout dinner and the reception we'd just go 7-11p at $15\/pp per hr? Exactly. The 8$\/pp for the cocktail hour is what I know of...<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSorry for bombarding but we have such a limited time!!! Thanks for your help ladies![\/quote]\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"j.krolak7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.179.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399042063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jennbotts","Id":277816,"Name":"jennbotts","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.29.64.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9624618a72287c4f5290ea321fe5569e","RawContent":"Can someone fwd me the pricing please svazquez309@[member=\"gmail\"].com","Attachments":[],"Id":1848202,"PostDate":1399212481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Can someone fwd me the pricing please svazquez309@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"svazquez309@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.29.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365951748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Slaughter2be","Id":268563,"Name":"Slaughter2be","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":67,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
