> Time: 1460853561 / Sun, 17 Apr 2016 00:39:21 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=76767&start=30&SessionId=3c8815573865f5d46f761723ef09ae4b
> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.174.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c18e3a83262df99dd42879444308420a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey guys!&amp;nbsp; Sorry I am so late in responding, I was away this weekend!&amp;nbsp; You can check out my wedding trailer if you&#039;d like, its &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/youtu.be\/_ZDn-Io2FRw&#039;&gt;http:\/\/youtu.be\/_ZDn-Io2FRw&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; At around the 6:25 mark is where you can really see Kukua!&amp;nbsp; The beginning of the video as well, but that is when the party is really going =)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;First off, I just want to let any future brides know that if you are thinking of booking here, do NOT think twice. My new husband and I, along with our 38 guests were treated with impeccable service and warmth - never have I had better quality anywhere else. Everything was simply AMAZING!!!!\n\n\nCommunication with Bego was very easy; everything is done through email, and she is very welcoming with pictures and ideas. Response time was perfect, and I did not have to wait longer than a few days for any of my answers. During the last couple weeks leading up to the wedding, response time was within hours.\n\n\nMy husband and I went for a tasting a couple of days before the wedding, and we were so, so impressed with Bego&#039;s organization and excitement regarding our day. She had a welcome drink waiting for us (champage sangria - amazing!!), and we sampled every item off our menu, which was octopus ceviche, natural fries, chicken ceaser salad with chicken croquettes, main course chicken &amp;amp; fish, and then creme brulee and cheesecake. Everything was amazing and we were so satisfied with the quailty of the delicious food and service! Bego even had our menucards and placecards all finished and decorated beautifully.\n\n\n\nWedding day - breathtaking. As I write this review, I am getting goosebumps. The whole reception was excellent and blew us all away. Decor was more beautiful than I could have imagined, from the floating candle in the pool, to the welcome table; everything was just magical. Food was delicious, and enjoyed by all. DJ and MC, as well as the dance floor area with a cover over the small pool was so worth it!!\n\n\nI could go on forever about this amazing venue and restaurant...One thing that stood out the most was the attentiveness of the staff and servers. They are simply the best. Whenever a guest&#039;s drink was near empty, someone was there to replenish it with whatever they wanted, both at dinner and during the dance.\n\n\nTo all future brides - if you are lucky enough to have your wedding day available at Kukua Beach Club, book and don&#039;t think twice!!! Your day will be one that you will cherish forever.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my review from Trip Advisor =)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848304,"PostDate":1399294822,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey guys!\u00a0 Sorry I am so late in responding, I was away this weekend!\u00a0 You can check out my wedding trailer if you'd like, its <a href='http:\/\/youtu.be\/_ZDn-Io2FRw' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/youtu.be\/_ZDn-Io2FRw<\/a>\u00a0 At around the 6:25 mark is where you can really see Kukua!\u00a0 The beginning of the video as well, but that is when the party is really going =)<\/p>\n<br \/><p>First off, I just want to let any future brides know that if you are thinking of booking here, do NOT think twice. My new husband and I, along with our 38 guests were treated with impeccable service and warmth - never have I had better quality anywhere else. Everything was simply AMAZING!!!!<br><br>\nCommunication with Bego was very easy; everything is done through email, and she is very welcoming with pictures and ideas. Response time was perfect, and I did not have to wait longer than a few days for any of my answers. During the last couple weeks leading up to the wedding, response time was within hours.<br><br>\nMy husband and I went for a tasting a couple of days before the wedding, and we were so, so impressed with Bego's organization and excitement regarding our day. She had a welcome drink waiting for us (champage sangria - amazing!!), and we sampled every item off our menu, which was octopus ceviche, natural fries, chicken ceaser salad with chicken croquettes, main course chicken & fish, and then creme brulee and cheesecake. Everything was amazing and we were so satisfied with the quailty of the delicious food and service! Bego even had our menucards and placecards all finished and decorated beautifully.<br><br><br>\nWedding day - breathtaking. As I write this review, I am getting goosebumps. The whole reception was excellent and blew us all away. Decor was more beautiful than I could have imagined, from the floating candle in the pool, to the welcome table; everything was just magical. Food was delicious, and enjoyed by all. DJ and MC, as well as the dance floor area with a cover over the small pool was so worth it!!<br><br>\nI could go on forever about this amazing venue and restaurant...One thing that stood out the most was the attentiveness of the staff and servers. They are simply the best. Whenever a guest's drink was near empty, someone was there to replenish it with whatever they wanted, both at dinner and during the dance.<br><br>\nTo all future brides - if you are lucky enough to have your wedding day available at Kukua Beach Club, book and don't think twice!!! Your day will be one that you will cherish forever.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my review from Trip Advisor =)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><em>Bling in Bloom - Floral Brooch Bouquets<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/blinginbloom'><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/blinginbloom<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">blinginbloom@outlook.com<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">@blinginbloom<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">IG: blinginbloom<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1846014]' id='ipb-attach-url-27633-0-43367200-1460853561' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-245252-0-26302500-1398353459.jpg\" title=\"IMG_4232.JPG -  69.91KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-245252-0-26302500-1398353459_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27633-0-43367200-1460853561' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"IMG_4232.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"cindy_cashman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.174.59","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315908199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245252.jpg?_r=1398353899","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cindy2013","Id":245252,"Name":"cindy2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a97d446fa0b386b7b75c7f28126e5fd2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Slaughter2be\"] I just sent you an email!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848559,"PostDate":1399412796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268563\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268563-slaughter2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Slaughter2be<\/span><\/a> I just sent you an email!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.151.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aebf34bead46692e5333146289347f01","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are a team of two Canadian photographers based in Punta Cana. &amp;nbsp;If you are still looking for a wedding photographer, feel free to e-mail me at julia@juliaeskin.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve shot a wedding at Kukua some time ago and it was absolutely gorgeous! &amp;nbsp;You check out the photos here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com\/p122563168#h2d1bd0f2&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com\/p122563168#h2d1bd0f2&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848630,"PostDate":1399459257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are a team of two Canadian photographers based in Punta Cana. \u00a0If you are still looking for a wedding photographer, feel free to e-mail me at julia@juliaeskin.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've shot a wedding at Kukua some time ago and it was absolutely gorgeous! \u00a0You check out the photos here:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com\/p122563168#h2d1bd0f2' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.juliaeski...63168#h2d1bd0f2<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Creative documentary wedding photographer in Punta Cana!<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com'>www.juliaeskin.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julia@juliaeskin.com","IpAddress":"187.153.56.51","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1270568042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227096.jpg?_r=1392861573","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julia Eskin","Id":227096,"Name":"Julia Eskin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.3.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b3444024e82fe4061994e200ea8e0ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cindy2013\"] Thanks for sharing! Your wedding and party look amazing!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848636,"PostDate":1399462651,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"245252\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/245252-cindy2013\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cindy2013<\/span><\/a> Thanks for sharing! Your wedding and party look amazing!!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drenna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.167.198.72","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1371509064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270677.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duchovny0901","Id":270677,"Name":"duchovny0901","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.29.64.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"adddfca12b22152eb5e6bcbd230d64ef","RawContent":"[quote name=\"duchovny0901\" post=\"1848559\" timestamp=\"1399427196\"]\n@[member=\"Slaughter2be\"] I just sent you an email![\/quote] thank you","Attachments":[],"Id":1848813,"PostDate":1399486760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>duchovny0901, on 06 May 2014 - 09:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268563\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268563-slaughter2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Slaughter2be<\/span><\/a> I just sent you an email!<\/p><\/div><\/div> thank you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"svazquez309@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.29.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365951748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Slaughter2be","Id":268563,"Name":"Slaughter2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.119.174.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7c1d9f9db06a4de9ba9dc69b22fd67b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We just booked Kukua for our July 11, 2015 wedding and couldn&#039;t be more excited. My fiance and I had the chance to go down to Punta Cana in April and see Kukua in person and meet with Bego. It is more beautiful that pictures can show and Bego is an &lt;u&gt;absolute&lt;\/u&gt; sweetheart. I&#039;m so happy to get to work with her! We are SO excited.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I do have a question for any past\/current brides--we are trying to decide if we should have the photographer\/videographer come to the resort to capture us getting ready or if it makes more sense to hire someone for hair and makeup to come to Kukua. I know that I have seen some resorts charge a \"vendor fee\" for weddings (We will be staying at Majestic Elegance and it is $300.00 per vendor) but since we are just getting ready can we buy them a \"day pass\"? I hate to spend $600 to bring the videographer\/photographer to the resort for an hour. If anyone has info on this we would GREATLY appreciate it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much! xo&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850177,"PostDate":1400011818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>We just booked Kukua for our July 11, 2015 wedding and couldn't be more excited. My fiance and I had the chance to go down to Punta Cana in April and see Kukua in person and meet with Bego. It is more beautiful that pictures can show and Bego is an <u>absolute<\/u> sweetheart. I'm so happy to get to work with her! We are SO excited.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I do have a question for any past\/current brides--we are trying to decide if we should have the photographer\/videographer come to the resort to capture us getting ready or if it makes more sense to hire someone for hair and makeup to come to Kukua. I know that I have seen some resorts charge a \"vendor fee\" for weddings (We will be staying at Majestic Elegance and it is $300.00 per vendor) but since we are just getting ready can we buy them a \"day pass\"? I hate to spend $600 to bring the videographer\/photographer to the resort for an hour. If anyone has info on this we would GREATLY appreciate it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much! xo<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aking0831@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.28.4.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388682640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275842.jpg?_r=1400026712","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ak1029","Id":275842,"Name":"ak1029","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.151.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33522088c6095f66b82707f023a2ed1c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ak1029\" post=\"1850177\" timestamp=\"1400026218\"]\nHi Ladies!\nWe just booked Kukua for our July 11, 2015 wedding and couldn&#039;t be more excited. My fiance and I had the chance to go down to Punta Cana in April and see Kukua in person and meet with Bego. It is more beautiful that pictures can show and Bego is an [u]absolute[\/u] sweetheart. I&#039;m so happy to get to work with her! We are SO excited.\n\nI do have a question for any past\/current brides--we are trying to decide if we should have the photographer\/videographer come to the resort to capture us getting ready or if it makes more sense to hire someone for hair and makeup to come to Kukua. I know that I have seen some resorts charge a \"vendor fee\" for weddings (We will be staying at Majestic Elegance and it is $300.00 per vendor) but since we are just getting ready can we buy them a \"day pass\"? I hate to spend $600 to bring the videographer\/photographer to the resort for an hour. If anyone has info on this we would GREATLY appreciate it!\n\nThanks so much! xo[\/quote]\nI would ask your photographer! If you do have a local photographer, chances are you will have to pay the vendor fee, since a lot of the staff at the resorts know local photographers (especially Majestic being one of the most popular resorts for weddings)\nFrom our experience, unfortunately two of our couples were required to pay the vendor fee even though they were not getting married at Majestic. \nIt&#039;s best if you check with the resort directly too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1850214,"PostDate":1400019793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ak1029, on 13 May 2014 - 08:10 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>We just booked Kukua for our July 11, 2015 wedding and couldn't be more excited. My fiance and I had the chance to go down to Punta Cana in April and see Kukua in person and meet with Bego. It is more beautiful that pictures can show and Bego is an <u>absolute<\/u> sweetheart. I'm so happy to get to work with her! We are SO excited.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I do have a question for any past\/current brides--we are trying to decide if we should have the photographer\/videographer come to the resort to capture us getting ready or if it makes more sense to hire someone for hair and makeup to come to Kukua. I know that I have seen some resorts charge a \"vendor fee\" for weddings (We will be staying at Majestic Elegance and it is $300.00 per vendor) but since we are just getting ready can we buy them a \"day pass\"? I hate to spend $600 to bring the videographer\/photographer to the resort for an hour. If anyone has info on this we would GREATLY appreciate it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much! xo<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would ask your photographer! If you do have a local photographer, chances are you will have to pay the vendor fee, since a lot of the staff at the resorts know local photographers (especially Majestic being one of the most popular resorts for weddings)<br>\nFrom our experience, unfortunately two of our couples were required to pay the vendor fee even though they were not getting married at Majestic.\u00a0<br>\nIt's best if you check with the resort directly too!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Creative documentary wedding photographer in Punta Cana!<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com'>www.juliaeskin.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julia@juliaeskin.com","IpAddress":"187.153.56.51","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1270568042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227096.jpg?_r=1392861573","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julia Eskin","Id":227096,"Name":"Julia Eskin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.174.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4238f69bb0dca93e376aee752d870ba0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I had to pay the vendor fee, although I did get married at the Majestic. &amp;nbsp;Just had the reception at the Kukua..kind of disappointing to spend that money, but they do have a close relationship with the video\/photograpthers and definitely know who&#039;s who. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;d probably suggest shopping around - you could always stage pictures as well at Kukua (just a thought). &amp;nbsp;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850346,"PostDate":1400083876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I had to pay the vendor fee, although I did get married at the Majestic. \u00a0Just had the reception at the Kukua..kind of disappointing to spend that money, but they do have a close relationship with the video\/photograpthers and definitely know who's who. \u00a0I'd probably suggest shopping around - you could always stage pictures as well at Kukua (just a thought). \u00a0Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><em>Bling in Bloom - Floral Brooch Bouquets<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/blinginbloom'><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/blinginbloom<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">blinginbloom@outlook.com<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">@blinginbloom<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,0,130);\"><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">IG: blinginbloom<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1846014]' id='ipb-attach-url-27633-0-58795800-1460853561' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-245252-0-26302500-1398353459.jpg\" title=\"IMG_4232.JPG -  69.91KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-245252-0-26302500-1398353459_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27633-0-58795800-1460853561' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"IMG_4232.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"cindy_cashman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.174.59","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315908199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245252.jpg?_r=1398353899","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cindy2013","Id":245252,"Name":"cindy2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2d1173fff514b354115bb1d5a36258a","RawContent":"Congrats everyone","Attachments":[],"Id":1851002,"PostDate":1400405420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats everyone \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdevries@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359762644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kardev","Id":265520,"Name":"Kardev","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.38.142.213","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76767,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2a4fae171e435797becfc715e23e986","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can the ladies that got married at the Kukua already give me some info about tipping.&amp;nbsp; I have no idea how to go about this and what to tip.&amp;nbsp; Any kind of advice would be great.&amp;nbsp; Feel free to&amp;nbsp;PM me :)&amp;nbsp; Thanks Ladies&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866400,"PostDate":1408028692,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can the ladies that got married at the Kukua already give me some info about tipping.\u00a0 I have no idea how to go about this and what to tip.\u00a0 Any kind of advice would be great.\u00a0 Feel free to\u00a0PM me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Thanks Ladies<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni_lee2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.14.163.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389790444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cottagegirl","Id":276105,"Name":"cottagegirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":67,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
