t;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married in Jamaica (I&#039;m Jamaican) and my guests that are travelling will all be staying in a variety of locations (some with family, some at AIs, some at villas) so leaving the bag with their rooms has logistical issues (lol). Most however are travelling from right here in Toronto where I live so it would be easier it seems to get it to them pre-travel.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does this makes sense or is there something I&#039;m missing that would make this mot work?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912822,"PostDate":1460493947,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone done pre-wedding OOT bags\/kits?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm getting married in Jamaica (I'm Jamaican) and my guests that are travelling will all be staying in a variety of locations (some with family, some at AIs, some at villas) so leaving the bag with their rooms has logistical issues (lol). Most however are travelling from right here in Toronto where I live so it would be easier it seems to get it to them pre-travel.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does this makes sense or is there something I'm missing that would make this mot work?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.117","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5760e644ab5071ccde8837931bb0527a","RawContent":"Since most live in Toronto I think handing out before you go is a good idea. Shipping may turn out costly! \n\n\nSince everyone stayed at the same resort I just did ours there. \n\n\nWe did pre travel mailers which includes a brochure and luggage tags! \n\n\nGood luck \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1912823,"PostDate":1460498154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Since most live in Toronto I think handing out before you go is a good idea. Shipping may turn out costly! <br><br>\nSince everyone stayed at the same resort I just did ours there. <br><br>\nWe did pre travel mailers which includes a brochure and luggage tags! <br><br>\nGood luck <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80039","Title":"Pre Travel Oot?","LastPostDate":1460498154},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
